    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brian Gleeson Property are delighted to present this lovely three-bedroom bungalow, set on circa 7 acres and enjoying a beautiful setting bordering the Finnisk River.\r\n\r\nPacked with potential, this property offers a fantastic opportunity to create your own dream home and lifestyle. The bungalow is ideal for those looking to downsize, while the generous site offers plenty of scope for a growing family or anyone with a vision for something truly special.\r\n\r\nFor equestrian enthusiasts, the property is particularly appealing, with circa 6 acres of land suitable for a pony or two, together with sheds incorporating six stables. The mature garden and extensive grounds provide wonderful space for outdoor living, gardening and recreation, with plenty of room to extend or further develop the property, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb for those seeking country living; close to Cappoquin and the heritage town of Lismore, while the coastal towns of Dungarvan and Youghal are just a short drive away, offering an excellent range of shops, schools, restaurants, beaches and local amenities.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a family home, rightsizing, an equestrian property, a peaceful rural retreat or somewhere to create your forever home, this property offers endless possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe property can also be sold in one or more lots, with a separate entrance to the land and sheds, offering additional flexibility to prospective purchasers.\r\n\r\nCall Brian Gleeson Property today for your private viewing."
      },
